    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "A small casual turn based game where you play as a thief collecting money bags or the police gathering clues to locate the thief.<br>At the same time, you can sharpen up your geography skills, learn where countries and it\u00b4s neighbors are located.<br><br><strong>Thief</strong><br>Collecting money bags while trying to avoid the police. Choose your countries wisely, if the police use it\u00b4s scanner and you are inside the borders of the same or a neighboring country, you get caught! <br>As a thief you can also try to collect cards, all unique to a certain country.<br><br><strong>Police</strong><br>Take control over 3 police officers and try to locate the thief. <br>Collect footprints to gain clues where the thief might be going and use your abilities carefully.<br><br><strong>BEFORE YOU BUY</strong><br>Please keep in mind this game does not offer much depth and is designed for short sessions, for when you just want to pass some time.<br>Check out the three minute gameplay video to see if this is a game for you.<br><br><strong>FEATURES</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Short session game (15-25 minutes) For when you just want to pastime.<br></li><li>22 country cards, all presenting something famous for that country.<br></li><li>Interactive tutorial.<br></li><li>Three maps to play on, Eurasia (Europe and Asia), Eurafrasia (Europe, Asia and Africa), World (All continents)<br></li><li>Easy, medium and hard difficulty levels.<br></li><li>Up to 139 countries to travel between.<br></li><li>Improve your geography skills.<br></li><li>Play as a thief or the police. Human, cat or dog.</li></ul>",
